   "updated": 1770000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "\u00abinterface\u00bb GameDefinition<S,\n        I extends Intent, E extends GameEvent>\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nString id()      int version()\nint minPlayers()   int maxPlayers()\n\nI  parseIntent(JsonNode raw)        the JSON boundary\nS  createInitialState(List<Seat>,\n        Map<String,String> options, EngineContext)\nValidation canJoin(S, Seat)\nValidation validate(S, I, PlayerId actor)\nList<E>    reduce(S, I, EngineContext)       pure\nS          apply(S, E)                       pure fold\nOptional<Turn> turn(S)          who is on the clock\nI          onTimeout(S, PlayerId)\nPlayerView project(S, Optional<PlayerId>)\n                            empty viewer = spectator\nboolean isHandComplete(S)    boolean isComplete(S)",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "\u00abinterface\u00bb GameDefinition<S,\n        I extends Intent, E extends GameEvent>\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nString id()      int version()\nint minPlayers()   int maxPlayers()\n\nI  parseIntent(JsonNode raw)        the JSON boundary\nS  createInitialState(List<Seat>,\n        Map<String,String> options, EngineContext)\nValidation canJoin(S, Seat)\nValidation validate(S, I, PlayerId actor)\nList<E>    reduce(S, I, EngineContext)       pure\nS          apply(S, E)                       pure fold\nOptional<Turn> turn(S)          who is on the clock\nI          onTimeout(S, PlayerId)\nPlayerView project(S, Optional<PlayerId>)\n                            empty viewer = spectator\nboolean isHandComplete(S)    boolean isComplete(S)",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
