   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "final class GameSession<S, I extends Intent,\n                        E extends GameEvent>\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n- GameDefinition<S,I,E> def\n- volatile S  state          deeply immutable\n- EventLog<E> log     - long seq\n+ Outcome  submit(JsonNode raw, PlayerId actor)\n           wildcard-safe: no I in the signature\n+ Snapshot snapshotFor(Optional<PlayerId>)\n\nstatic <S,I,E> GameSession<S,I,E> open(\n       GameDefinition<S,I,E>, ...)   capture helper",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "final class GameSession<S, I extends Intent,\n                        E extends GameEvent>\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n- GameDefinition<S,I,E> def\n- volatile S  state          deeply immutable\n- EventLog<E> log     - long seq\n+ Outcome  submit(JsonNode raw, PlayerId actor)\n           wildcard-safe: no I in the signature\n+ Snapshot snapshotFor(Optional<PlayerId>)\n\nstatic <S,I,E> GameSession<S,I,E> open(\n       GameDefinition<S,I,E>, ...)   capture helper",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
