   "updated": 1770000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "final class EventLog<E extends GameEvent>\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n- List<SequencedEvent<E>> events\n+ long append(E e, long at, int v)\n+ List<SequencedEvent<E>> since(long seq)\n+ <S> S replay(S init, GameDefinition<S,?,E>)\n        E is bound by the log \u2014 no cast",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "final class EventLog<E extends GameEvent>\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n- List<SequencedEvent<E>> events\n+ long append(E e, long at, int v)\n+ List<SequencedEvent<E>> since(long seq)\n+ <S> S replay(S init, GameDefinition<S,?,E>)\n        E is bound by the log \u2014 no cast",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
