   "text": "final class TurnClock\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n- ScheduledExecutorService   platform threads\n+ void arm(RoomCode, Turn, long armedAtSeq)\n+ void cancel(RoomCode)\n  on expiry: offer(new Timeout(armedAtSeq, actor))\n  never touches def.* or state",
