   "text": "final class RoomRegistry\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n- ConcurrentHashMap<RoomCode,RoomActor> rooms\n+ RoomActor create(String gameId, PlayerId host)\n+ Optional<RoomActor> find(RoomCode)\n+ void reapIdle(Duration grace)",
