   "text": "final class Room\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nRoomCode code  String gameId  PlayerId hostId\nList<Seat> seats   Phase phase\nMap<String,String> options   List<Hand> hands\nrecord Hand(int index, String commit,\n     byte[] serverSeed, long startSeq, long endSeq)\n     THE SEED IS PER HAND, NEVER PER ROOM",
   "fontSize": 12,
